WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.877 --> 00:00:07.295
It’s 400 miles to Azna.

00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:09.654
Long way to go for a party.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:16.893
Face it David, we’re lost.

00:00:16.893 --> 00:00:17.593
That’s the turn.

00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:18.109
No it’s not.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:18.700
This is the turn!

00:00:18.709 --> 00:00:19.377
No, David.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:20.478
Don’t be so bloody stupid.

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:27.325
It was an accident.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.376
He stepped out in front of us.

00:00:29.376 --> 00:00:30.128
We didn’t want the police showing up.

00:00:31.494 --> 00:00:33.038
Poking their noses into everything.

00:00:34.778 --> 00:00:36.232
You got into a car with a drunk,

00:00:36.232 --> 00:00:37.155
which makes you an accessory.

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:39.091
Feel like I’ve been an accessory

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:40.157
for a long time now.

00:00:41.715 --> 00:00:43.717
Now listen, are you
going to mope all weekend,

00:00:43.759 --> 00:00:44.471
or are you going to enjoy yourself?

00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:46.841
It’s not a crime to enjoy yourself,

00:00:46.841 --> 00:00:47.341
you know.

00:00:47.929 --> 00:00:49.514
I suppose I can make the effort.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:58.724
Did he mention money?

00:00:58.893 --> 00:00:59.393
No.

00:00:59.856 --> 00:01:01.107
He wants you to return with them

00:01:01.107 --> 00:01:01.607
to bury the boy.

00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:03.977
It is customary in these parts.

00:01:08.358 --> 00:01:09.610
People disappear here.

00:01:09.718 --> 00:01:11.011
They just vanish.

00:01:26.557 --> 00:01:27.725
What did you do with his ID?

00:01:29.407 --> 00:01:29.907
Bury it.

00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:32.584
They didn’t just hit him.

00:01:33.102 --> 00:01:34.144
They ran over him.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.571
Maybe more than once.

00:01:37.143 --> 00:01:38.436
What do they call it in your country?

00:01:38.685 --> 00:01:39.644
Roadkill.

00:01:42.603 --> 00:01:45.565
There’s nowhere to run,
nowhere to hide.

00:01:49.382 --> 00:01:50.224
Has it occurred to you

00:01:50.224 --> 00:01:51.600
that he might actually be planning

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.893
something a lot nastier

00:01:52.893 --> 00:01:54.478
than anything you can anticipate?

00:01:56.596 --> 00:01:58.180
You’ve forgotten about my husband.

00:01:58.564 --> 00:01:59.315
Yes I have.

00:01:59.771 --> 00:02:00.439
And so have you.

00:02:07.123 --> 00:02:07.915
Why did you come here?

